`crimes context src/petty.ts --format json` returns four findings (all `low`), three of which are the petty crimes named in the brief. It also surfaces a fourth — `boolean_naming_drift` @L34 — which is the same two identifiers as the negative-flag maze, so I've folded it into that fix.

